---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          COMPLETE MARKETING AUTOMATION FOR ECOMMERCE AND RETAILERS
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
          Create Intelligent Workflows for Effective Results on Bigcommerce 
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
            Create AI powered workflows for engagement retention and acquisition of users </br>
            Grow your store and drive revenue with loyalty marketing automation.
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          role="img"
          class="object-cover -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950" width="1280" height="739"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.webp"
          alt="Workflows for Bigcommerce gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h2
              class="text-4xl font-medium">
              Integrate
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
              Effortlessly connect your Bigcommerce store with premier eCommerce platforms and associated apps, creating more tailored workflows. Quickly generate impactful and efficient experiences at every stage of the customer journey with just a few simple clicks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-4xl font-medium">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Create tailored workflows to launch sophisticated, data-driven marketing campaigns. Seamlessly integrate features like Bigcommerce store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into complex workflows that are engineered to engage, convert, and keep customers.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-4xl font-medium">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
              Design fully automated, data-driven campaigns that are custom-tailored for your customers. Offer personalized incentives based on each customer's activities and profile, including rewards, cash backs, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, store credits, and more, to enhance engagement and loyalty. 
          </p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
